{"municipality_code":"12239","pref":"千葉県","city":"大網白里市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"大網白里市には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「大網山田台第８遺跡」、「南麦台遺跡」、「大網山田台第３遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では石井雙石や斉藤巻石に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「縣神社」や「八幡神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":90,"rank":655,"percentile":65.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":24,"rank":647,"percentile":65.5,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":10,"rank":1624,"percentile":11.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":8,"rank":1011,"percentile":40.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":43,"rank":435,"percentile":76.6,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["石井雙石","斉藤巻石","大見嵜八之助","紫雲竜吉之助","竜ヶ